      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Trigger Explanation**\n\nThis trigger will run automatically **every 6 months** on the **first day of the month** at **10:00 AM**.  \n\nIt ensures the workflow executes twice a year:\n- **January 1st, 10:00 AM**\n- **July 1st, 10:00 AM**\n",
        "height": 448,
        "width": 256,
        "color": 3
