    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Bi-Annual Performance Review Workflow**\n\n### **Flow Explanation**\n\n1. **Set Due Date**  \n   - Calculates today’s date and the due date (14 days later).\n\n2. **Get Department Manager Email**  \n   - Reads the department manager’s email from the Google Sheets checklist.\n\n3. **Distribute Review Form Through Email**  \n   - Sends an email to the manager with the performance review form link.  \n   - Includes the due date in the message.\n\n4. **Set Status as Pending**  \n   - Updates the Google Sheets checklist to update the assigned date with today’s date, due date, and status set to *Pending*.\n",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 800
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        32,
        -480
      ],
      "id": "c77aaeba-119b-42e1-913e-cbfcf4cee8a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## **Activate Performance Review Checking Workflow**\n\n### **Flow Explanation**\n\n- **Activate Performance Review Checking Workflow**  \n  This node activates another workflow called **Performance Review Checking**.  \n  It ensures that once the performance review emails are sent and statuses are updated, the review checking process is automatically enabled.\n",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 416,
        "color": 3
